\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Optimization Fundamentals\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 At the end of the day you are always trying to do the following:\
More good, less bad.\
That is the forever game you are playing.\
It is up to you to define what is good - e.g. 300% ROAS target for eCommerce or maybe a $50 CPA for lead form fill for led gen\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

