\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Campaign Structure\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The key to structure is to consolidate as much as possible but only when it makes sense.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

