\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Bidding\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Bidding is technically a Campaign setting. However, I\'92ve included it towards the end as a separate section since bidding will not save an account with poor campaign structure, incorrect settings, and bad keywords and ad groups.\
A lot of people bank too much of their success on bidding. Bidding just steers the math of the campaign/ad groups to hit your goal.\
Your success is going to come from everything else discussed. Bidding is just the steering wheel.\
With that said, you should be testing and adjusting bids when necessary. Bidding is a large topic so I\'92ve included an entire masterclass on Bidding that I recorded on YouTube:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/IKLR3z0dtgs"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://youtu.be/IKLR3z0dtgs}}\
