\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Auction Insights Report\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Auction Insights report gives you data on competitors who you are competing with in the same ad auctions for your keywords.\
You should be reviewing the Auction Insights report frequently to make sure you don\'92t see any changes in competitor aggressiveness or spot any new competitors entering the ad auctions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

